## Active Skills & Agents
- `subagent-council`: Review prompt before coding and review project before closing.
- `subagent-helper`: Offload isolated search, test generation, and mechanical refactoring.
- `subagent-driven-development`: Dispatch task-by-task execution with fresh context.
- `verification-before-completion`: Gated command check (exit code 0 required).
- `systematic-debugging`: Reproduce and trace before proposing fixes.
- `ui-ux`: Design intelligence, visual hierarchy, responsive layout, and accessibility.